{"title":"蓝桥杯真题解析：最长递增子数组","slug":"2024-03-26-最长递增","date":"2024-03-25T23:45:13.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.062Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-03-26-最长递增.json","excerpt":null,"covers":["/images/LQ158_1.png"],"content":"<h2 id=\"题目背景\"><a href=\"#题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目背景\"></a>题目背景</h2><p>本题出自蓝桥杯历年真题，主要考察对数组序列的处理能力。题目要求在一个给定的数字序列中，寻找最长的连续递增子序列的长度。</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"/images/LQ158_1.png\" alt=\"题目描述示意图\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"解法一：暴力切片法\"><a href=\"#解法一：暴力切片法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解法一：暴力切片法\"></a>解法一：暴力切片法</h2><h3 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h3><p>最直观的思路是枚举数组中的所有可能的连续子数组（切片），然后判断该切片是否为严格递增序列。</p>\n<p>具体步骤如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用双重循环枚举所有子数组的起点 <code>i</code> 和终点 <code>j</code>。</li>\n<li>提取切片 <code>temp = li[i:j]</code>。</li>\n<li>将切片排序，若排序后与原切片一致，则说明该切片有序。</li>\n<li>记录所有有序切片的最大长度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">li = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()))</span><br><span class=\"line\">len_list = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 枚举所有可能的子数组切片</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(li)):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 注意：Python切片右边界不包含，range应到len(li)+1以包含最后一个元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(li) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        temp = li[i:j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(temp) != <span class=\"number\">0</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 通过对比排序后的列表判断是否递增</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            sort_temp = <span class=\"built_in\">sorted</span>(temp)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> sort_temp == temp:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                len_list.append(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(temp))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(len_list))</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">该解法包含双重循环，且切片操作和排序操作均消耗时间，整体时间复杂度较高，约为 $O(N^<span class=\"number\">3</span>)$ 或更高（取决于切片长度），在面对大数据量时容易超时。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 解法二：贪心遍历法（推荐）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 思路分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目要求的是**连续**递增子序列。利用贪心思想，我们只需要遍历一次数组：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> 维护一个当前递增长度 `count` 和最大递增长度 `countmax`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> 从左向右遍历，比较当前元素 `ls[i]` 与下一个元素 `ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span> 若 `ls[i] &lt; ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]`，说明递增继续，计数器 `count` 加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span> 否则，说明递增中断，重置计数器 `count` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span>（当前元素自身作为一个新的起点）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span> 每次更新后，维护 `countmax` 的最大值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码实现</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![代码运行结果示意](/images/LQ158_2.png)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">ls = [*<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split())]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">countmax = <span class=\"number\">1</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 记录全局最大长度，初始至少为1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">count = <span class=\"number\">1</span>     <span class=\"comment\"># 记录当前递增长度</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(ls) - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ls[i] &lt; ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 满足递增，计数加一</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        count += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 递增中断，重置计数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        count = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 更新最大值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    countmax = <span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(countmax, count)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(countmax)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">该解法仅需遍历数组一次，时间复杂度为 $O(N)$，空间复杂度为 $O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$（不计输入存储），是解决此类问题的最优解法。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于连续序列问题，暴力法虽然直观但效率低下。通过观察序列特征，利用单指针或双指针进行一次遍历，往往能将复杂度降低到线性级别。在算法竞赛中，优先考虑 $O(N)$ 的贪心或动态规划思路是关键。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![算法总结图示](/images/LQ158_3.png)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"题目背景\"><a href=\"#题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目背景\"></a>题目背景</h2><p>本题出自蓝桥杯历年真题，主要考察对数组序列的处理能力。题目要求在一个给定的数字序列中，寻找最长的连续递增子序列的长度。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/LQ158_1.png\" alt=\"题目描述示意图\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"解法一：暴力切片法\"><a href=\"#解法一：暴力切片法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解法一：暴力切片法\"></a>解法一：暴力切片法</h2><h3 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h3><p>最直观的思路是枚举数组中的所有可能的连续子数组（切片），然后判断该切片是否为严格递增序列。</p>\n<p>具体步骤如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用双重循环枚举所有子数组的起点 <code>i</code> 和终点 <code>j</code>。</li>\n<li>提取切片 <code>temp = li[i:j]</code>。</li>\n<li>将切片排序，若排序后与原切片一致，则说明该切片有序。</li>\n<li>记录所有有序切片的最大长度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">li = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()))</span><br><span class=\"line\">len_list = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 枚举所有可能的子数组切片</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(li)):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 注意：Python切片右边界不包含，range应到len(li)+1以包含最后一个元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(li) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        temp = li[i:j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(temp) != <span class=\"number\">0</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 通过对比排序后的列表判断是否递增</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            sort_temp = <span class=\"built_in\">sorted</span>(temp)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> sort_temp == temp:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                len_list.append(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(temp))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(len_list))</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">该解法包含双重循环，且切片操作和排序操作均消耗时间，整体时间复杂度较高，约为 $O(N^<span class=\"number\">3</span>)$ 或更高（取决于切片长度），在面对大数据量时容易超时。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 解法二：贪心遍历法（推荐）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 思路分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目要求的是**连续**递增子序列。利用贪心思想，我们只需要遍历一次数组：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> 维护一个当前递增长度 `count` 和最大递增长度 `countmax`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> 从左向右遍历，比较当前元素 `ls[i]` 与下一个元素 `ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span> 若 `ls[i] &lt; ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]`，说明递增继续，计数器 `count` 加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span> 否则，说明递增中断，重置计数器 `count` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span>（当前元素自身作为一个新的起点）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span> 每次更新后，维护 `countmax` 的最大值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码实现</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![代码运行结果示意](/images/LQ158_2.png)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">ls = [*<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split())]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">countmax = <span class=\"number\">1</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 记录全局最大长度，初始至少为1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">count = <span class=\"number\">1</span>     <span class=\"comment\"># 记录当前递增长度</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(ls) - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ls[i] &lt; ls[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 满足递增，计数加一</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        count += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 递增中断，重置计数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        count = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 更新最大值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    countmax = <span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(countmax, count)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(countmax)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">该解法仅需遍历数组一次，时间复杂度为 $O(N)$，空间复杂度为 $O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$（不计输入存储），是解决此类问题的最优解法。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于连续序列问题，暴力法虽然直观但效率低下。通过观察序列特征，利用单指针或双指针进行一次遍历，往往能将复杂度降低到线性级别。在算法竞赛中，优先考虑 $O(N)$ 的贪心或动态规划思路是关键。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![算法总结图示](/images/LQ158_3.png)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法刷题","path":"api/categories/算法刷题.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"算法","path":"api/tags/算法.json"}]}